- Numeric `time.format` now formats a UTC `DateTime`, preserving `%Z`/`%z`; added regression tests.
- `SURVEY.md` time inventory now lists `parse` and `from_unix` and citations point at the actual lines.
- `date_year` accepts 1–3 digit years again; added parent-compatible regression tests.
- Re-anchored SPEC/doc-block references and updated the phase report.

